From b61af6fa0bdbc726c331bf36c59a35753a27a8e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Microsoft ONNX Runtime
Date: Sun, 21 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Support ONNX 1.23.0: new float6 types and opset 28

Backport of the source changes from
https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime/pull/32359 ("Integrate ONNX
1.23.0 base plumbing"), which is still open upstream at the time of
writing.

onnxruntime 1.30.0 was released against ONNX 1.22.  ONNX 1.23.0 adds two
TensorProto data types, FLOAT6E2M3 (27) and FLOAT6E3M2 (28), and bumps
the ai.onnx opset to 28.  Building 1.30.0 against the conda-forge
libonnx 1.23.0 therefore fails at compile time:

    onnxruntime/core/framework/tensorprotoutils.h:76:58: error:
      static assertion failed: TensorProto data type element-size map
      must cover every numeric data type.

because kTensorProtoDataTypeElementSizes is sized by
TensorProto_DataType_DataType_ARRAYSIZE and the two new slots default to
zero.  onnxruntime_map_type_info.h has an equivalent consteval
bijectivity check against the ORT element-type enum.

This backport takes the upstream hunks under include/onnxruntime/ and
onnxruntime/core/ plus the C++ unit-test files, so the compiled ctest
suite keeps passing:

  * add ONNX_TENSOR_ELEMENT_DATA_TYPE_FLOAT6E2M3/FLOAT6E3M2 to the C API
    enum and map them in both directions;
  * extend the element-size table with the two packed 6-bit types;
  * raise the maximum supported opset from 27 to 28 in the transpose
    optimizer and the CoreML/NNAPI/VSINPU/WebNN op builders, keeping
    Q/DQ builders at 27 where upstream did;
  * teach the EmbedLayerNorm fusion about the opset-28 Cast, Squeeze and
    Range signatures;
  * honour session.allow_released_opsets_only when loading from memory.

Three upstream hunks are deliberately omitted:

  * onnxruntime/core/providers/webgpu/compute_context.h -- an unrelated
    Logger refactor for the EP adapter API that does not apply to 1.30.0
    and touches a provider this feedstock does not build;
  * onnxruntime/test/optimizer/qdq_transformer_test.cc -- pins a test
    that does not exist in 1.30.0;
  * the cmake/, vcpkg and requirements changes, which pin onnxruntime's
    own vendored ONNX; the conda-forge build links the packaged libonnx
    instead.
---
